'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': '‘It could be quite a brutal evening’: GOP braces for some once-unthinkable losses Some GOP incumbents are still begging for more money in the final stretch. <p>Republicans are bracing for a brutal election night, convinced they’re set to face some previously unthinkable losses in', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/30/republicans-brace-for-losses-2026-midterms-01141576'}, {'signal_id': 'edf45355c6e15134', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'The nation’s cartoonists on the week in politics Every week political cartoonists throughout the country and across the political spectrum apply their ink-stained skills to capture the foibles, memes, hypocrisies and other head-slapping events in the world of politics. The fruits', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/gallery/2026/10/30/the-nations-cartoonists-on-the-week-in-politics-01141593'}, {'signal_id': 'b619d32cbd4dc6dc', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Why the midterms are a warning sign for both parties <h3 class="title">Why the midterms are a warning sign for both parties</h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/446b326a-5964-4398-97c2-d76057918a33/73b887e7-af36-44fa-868b-de1af545b0', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/10/29/why-the-midterms-are-a-warning-sign-for-both-parties-2215580'}, {'signal_id': 'c82aa567504c0e78', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Turning Point rests its reputation on Andy Biggs’ race. It’s not looking good. The group founded by the late Charlie Kirk has thrown big money into the race to boost the last candidate Kirk endorsed before he was killed last year. <p>Turning Point USA has gone all-in to make GOP ', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/29/charlie-kirk-arizona-andy-biggs-turning-point-struggles-01140510'}, {'signal_id': 'c317fbfbd40588d6', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Moderates put the left on notice <h3 class="title">Moderates put the left on notice</h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/c22d63de-d311-4016-afc7-281f149a1860/64d51bd1-05ee-43bb-ae3e-12b70ba774a6/1280x720/match/image.jpg" />lead imag', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/10/29/moderates-put-the-left-on-notice-2215191'}, {'signal_id': 'd243dc692bf9f8a1', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'El-Sayed’s allies fear Trump’s anti-Muslim attacks are reaching undecided voters After Trump called him a “jihadist,” Abdul El-Sayed brushed off the “desperate, bad faith attacks” <p>DEARBORN, MICHIGAN — “A threat to America.” “Radical ideology.” “A jihadist.”</p><p>President Don', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/29/trump-muslim-attacks-michigan-el-sayed-01140171'}, {'signal_id': 'e5386d336287102b', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Billionaire taxes, trans rights, abortion, voting rights: This year’s biggest state votes At least $400 million has been spent on TV ads for ballot initiatives this cycle. <p>Statewide ballot measures are flying under the national radar — but some are drawing big spending.</p><p>', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/28/billionaire-taxes-trans-rights-abortion-voting-rights-this-years-biggest-state-votes-01138302'}, {'signal_id': 'b05f872829ed8e77', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Republicans rethink their attacks on AOC <h3 class="title">Republicans rethink their attacks on AOC</h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/2e63fb4c-2e39-4801-b4a1-41425e417b10/180a7696-6cef-4df0-bcc2-560710af0ab5/1280x720/match/image.', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/10/28/republicans-rethink-their-attacks-on-aoc-2214551'}, {'signal_id': '8723c13508214ad6', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Midwest Dems face their do or die moment to win back Trump districts before 2028 Voters from western Wisconsin over to southern Minnesota and down to eastern Iowa are hurting. The question is whether they blame the president’s policies enough to elect Democrats. <p>EAU CLAIRE, Wi', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/28/democrats-rural-midwest-rebecca-cooke-01137050'}, {'signal_id': '63eebde12b8bc973', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Republicans wanted Rubio on the stump. Trump coaxed him there. “We love you, Texas,” the secretary of State told the crowd. <p>Secretary of State Marco Rubio on Tuesday came as close to the campaign trail as he’s been all year. And even then, he tried to stay just offshore.</p> \n', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/27/marco-rubio-texas-trump-midterms-01137437'}, {'signal_id': '9a9c09e400e51d20', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Trump is still the center of the GOP money universe <h3 class="title">Trump is still the center of the GOP money universe</h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/00800ebb-3e0d-4bf6-a65d-4cd5b71d8b4b/9232b4d1-b0a5-4c17-b06c-09dfb577e60f', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/10/27/trump-is-still-the-center-of-the-gop-money-universe-2213216'}, {'signal_id': '7615818dcb86ca79', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Kathy Hochul on Trump, Mamdani and the future of New York <h3 class="title">Kathy Hochul on Trump, Mamdani and the future of New York </h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/8a10fb45-3994-42c6-8457-34e286d88af7/99b3a103-8902-4b0a-a060', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/10/27/kathy-hochul-on-trump-mamdani-and-the-future-of-new-york-2212608'}, {'signal_id': '106eeeb853208e6c', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'The hidden GOP fundraising weakness is getting worse Republican candidates’ struggles with online fundraising have left them more reliant on large donors and super PACs. <p>Republicans’ small-dollar donor base has contracted in recent years, leaving the party more dependent on a ', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/27/trump-gop-online-fundraising-problems-01135716'}, {'signal_id': '6041f7c211ed8bcc', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Blakeman’s bank statements don’t match his disclosure reports <img alt="GOP gubernatorial candidate Bruce Blakeman\'s campaign finance disclosure reports contain numerous inaccuracies." src="https://static.politico.com/15/6a/82caa34d434ebdf2d53aa3aa7539/trump-28727.jpg" /><p><b>🚨🚨', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/newsletters/new-york-playbook-pm/2026/10/26/blakemans-bank-statements-dont-match-his-disclosure-reports-01135549'}, {'signal_id': '6e5314a97bf1c317', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Why Dems’ late House reaches don’t usually pan out The DCCC has added nine candidates to its coveted "Red to Blue" support program since the beginning of September. Most face long odds. <p>House Democrats are pushing into redder and redder territory. History shows those last-minu', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/26/democrats-house-candidates-support-dccc-01134945'}, {'signal_id': '0161da905f467c59', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'The Epstein election? <h3 class="title">The Epstein election?</h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/41b8bec4-afac-4b8b-8d19-485367d693fa/1fb727f2-afec-4a55-879a-72f93ee0dfb9/1280x720/match/image.jpg" />lead image</p>', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/10/26/the-epstein-election-2211771'}, {'signal_id': '2e860edfa04f7e30', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': "Spurned by Trump, these outgoing Republicans aren’t helping their potential successors They were snubbed on their way out of office. Their revenge is indifference. <p>Republicans spurned by President Donald Trump aren't interested in rescuing their would-be replacements.</p> \n<p>", 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/26/republicans-trump-spurned-cornyn-tillis-amodei-01134258'}, {'signal_id': '00cf9a4aa784e445', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Iowa’s Senate rivals pitch independence from their parties Ashley Hinson qualified her pledge to be Trump’s strongest ally, while Josh Turek praised the president’s border record. <p>Republican Ashley Hinson wants Iowans to know she’ll pick a fight with President Donald Trump. De', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/25/iowa-senate-hinson-turek-independence-01134978'}, {'signal_id': '77316689995bc8b1', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'AI has a language gap. That could be a problem for some voters. AI models underperform in non-English languages, which national organizations and experts say unintentionally disenfranchises communities using AI for election information. <p>AI chatbots are feeding non-native Engli', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/25/ai-non-english-language-voters-01132772'}, {'signal_id': 'a16f1ffb01d938d0', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': "Australian defense land selloff runs into multiparty opposition Former PM Howard tells crowd: 'You don’t give that up for a few bob.' <p>SYDNEY — Former Prime Minister John Howard urged the Australian government to reverse its plans to sell defense land in prime locations at a ra", 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/25/australia-defense-land-selloff-nationalist-opposition-01134805'}, {'signal_id': '8abb56fc97dbcb3c', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Peltola postpones campaign stops after Saturday car crash The Alaska Senate candidate and her family sustained minor injuries, her campaign announced Sunday. <p>Former Rep. Mary Peltola is postponing campaign stops in her bid for Alaska’s Senate seat after she and her family sust', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/25/peltola-car-crash-postpones-campaign-stops-01134902'}, {'signal_id': 'cb9b673fb2ebc199', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'The 2028 crop hits New Mexico for inaugural ‘Matanza’ rally The “Fourth in the Nation Matanza Rally” is testing the appetite for a more Latino-specific cultural touchstone to round out the presidential candidate event rotation. <p>Prospective presidential candidates are known to ', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/24/2028-presidential-new-mexico-matanza-rally-01134655'}, {'signal_id': 'c2727885f6d35e38', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Facing an electoral wipeout, Trump goes after the system The move by the Justice Department to try and preemptively block Alaska’s Senate results if Republican Sen. Dan Sullivan loses stunned officials in both parties. <p>President Donald Trump is escalating his <a href="https://', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/24/trump-alaska-election-justice-department-01134590'}, {'signal_id': '585e4a85482e93f2', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Spiking ambulance response times spur calls for real-time tracking An ambulance in New York City now takes an average of 13 minutes to reach someone in life-threatening distress. <img alt="Amid spiking ambulance response times in New York City, council members have a new idea for', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/newsletters/new-york-playbook-pm/2026/10/23/spiking-ambulance-response-times-spur-calls-for-real-time-tracking-01134181'}, {'signal_id': '57964480cc69d41e', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'House battleground map tightens as GOP scrambles to shore up red seats Democrats are warning their party not to get too bullish about a big House majority. <p>Senior Democrats are tempering their expectations about how big of a House majority they might win, as both parties see a', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/23/democrats-house-map-election-expectations-01134127'}, {'signal_id': '04847281562aec48', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'The nation’s cartoonists on the week in politics Every week political cartoonists throughout the country and across the political spectrum apply their ink-stained skills to capture the foibles, memes, hypocrisies and other head-slapping events in the world of politics. The fruits', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/gallery/2026/10/23/the-nat